Handle AV1 CUDA tests on GPUs without AV1 NVDEC support.

NVIDIA A100 (GA100) supports CUDA decoding but does not implement AV1 in
NVDEC. Keep testing the default CUDA backend where AV1 is supported and
verify the beta backend CPU fallback otherwise. Use CPU-decoded AV1 frames
as references for beta-backend comparisons. No tests are skipped or
deselected.
Reported upstream: https://github.com/meta-pytorch/torchcodec/issues/1609

Author: Pavel Tomanek (Inuits/UGent) with help from ChatGPT5.6
